From 5583132334f3712644877895ec0c1357afb5ef6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gspu8ur0j4 <kortneythw.tyquisha@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:13:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Break up regular water speculars and square-tile noise
 artifacts

fs_water: replace lattice-aligned value noise with rotated-octave gradient-noise fBm plus domain warp (kills the axis-aligned square patches), derive ripple slopes from central differences of one height field, add low-frequency Gerstner phase jitter and sparkle modulation so the sun streak stops repeating in even rows, fade the fine ripple layer with distance instead of flattening the whole far field, and switch the foam mask to fBm. Regenerated fs_water.bin.h (SPIR-V).
